{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1000_p", "source_sha256": "27fc7bf798dfef77cb96d3a0399ee80f9bd562454ac946ea43a21ffe4ea91e52", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影。\n杏奈のテーマは『スケルトン』だ）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄平面杂志的联动企划。\n杏奈的主题是“骷髅”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "870b57b6952bcac4341e22a7962f043c9623af9a7910aa62e9bcafab04d8d1e0", "ja": "あの……{$P$}さんは……\nこの世に未練、ありますか……？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生……\n对这个世界，还有留恋吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cee99f2bbb5742409eeb34c2457bda6d768d152d8ed4ea98bb2f77c818d9adb6", "ja": "えっ？　えっと……\nその質問の意図を聞いてもいいか？", "zh": "诶？那个……\n可以问一下你这么问的用意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "ed1825b088d5892acf2f383ee6e82fcab2a266f21abda8289dd7aa5cafd657e8", "ja": "今日の杏奈はスケルトン……。だから、\n何か未練があって、生き返ったのかなって……。", "zh": "今天的杏奈是骷髅……所以，\n我在想，你是不是还有什么留恋，才死而复生的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "18b6016162b0641d95b10219087c6071c3f485404b8a7de953cdefef41a404d4", "ja": "骨になってもやりたいこと……\n{$P$}さんは、ある……？", "zh": "就算变成骨头，也有想做的事……{$P$}先生有吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b95bf1422a421820bacf10e9db88d2db9a4bf2ff7a3fe2c93ccabd018f7666a1", "ja": "なるほど。それで、その質問か……。\nそれはやっぱり……。", "zh": "原来如此。所以，才会问那个问题啊……\n果然还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1006_p", "source_sha256": "accf7c6828e3746dce10db80cdb2dbaab2f6029867bf493a0e7c6591ec069bad", "ja": "杏奈のプロデュースかな？　トップアイドルになる姿を\n見届けるまで、死ぬわけにはいかないよ。", "zh": "是要制作杏奈吗？在亲眼见证她成为顶级偶像之前，我可不能死啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "6a440943c9a5f73862b4c037aaede5b60b044f90f1e9ce4e84f5674352a77096", "ja": "そっか……。杏奈の、プロデュース……。", "zh": "这样啊……杏奈的……制作人之路……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "e2c420bfe969b10cbd325527307923dcb3c6b18aa9527e68513f505097568949", "ja": "杏奈も……同じ。アイドル、ずっとなりたくて……\nやっとなれたから……。まだ未練……あります。", "zh": "杏奈也……一样。一直都想成为偶像……\n好不容易才成为了偶像……所以……还是有些放不下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9b8adf0d4c9d6597b125a773f964f2b0cd12096b712f00e5cdb36535b3197871", "ja": "ははっ。それならお互い、骨になっても\nアイドルとプロデューサーをやってたりして。", "zh": "哈哈。那样的话，说不定我们就算化成了白骨，也还在继续当偶像和制作人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "3bd2fc6aeaf97d5c5f99bc6d414d7d4f34363d376e7d61634efefc1a1aca3330", "ja": "それはさすがに……ファンのみんなも、\nびっくりしちゃう、かも……。", "zh": "那未免也太……说不定会把粉丝们都吓一跳……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3aa876e852f48e234392cd4afc8cc3427265ffda4dea535db13bcac078fcb6f3", "ja": "そうかな？　杏奈みたいに可愛いスケルトンなら、\nトップアイドルになれると思うよ。", "zh": "是吗？要是像杏奈那样可爱的骷髅，应该能成为顶级偶像吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "89dbfc138dd8ef2df7c3b4bb024cdc79641e788013993d97378b3a751d18fd56", "ja": "えへへ……♪　{$P$}さんと\n一緒なら、本当になれちゃうかも……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪　如果和{$P$}先生\n在一起，说不定真的能变成那样呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "e20fe816e66148c244364aab41d7e94c5fa198b634b1e1ce6636ded6e8f46c1d", "ja": "じゃあ今日は、スケルトン杏奈のプロデュース……\nよろしく、ね……？", "zh": "那么今天，透明杏奈的制作工作……就拜托你了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fc75d4270326e0daf07c51567594d3ce2895632cff2a94279ca656802a45b433", "ja": "ああ！　一緒に頑張ろうな、杏奈！", "zh": "啊！一起加油吧，杏奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0633_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "32f1a30b9a9a1b40d958eb6a195fdf952443671b220598bf5ac431c635644b9c", "ja": "ん……♪\n未練、残さないように……最期まで頑張ります……♪", "zh": "嗯……♪\n为了不留下遗憾……我会努力到最后一刻……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
